        "cro_tabs": {
          "type": "cro_accordions",
          "settings": {
            "tab_2_title": "Simulator Compatibility",
            "tab_2_content": "<p>The Net Return works seamlessly with all major launch monitors and simulator systems. FlightScope, Foresight, Full Swing, Garmin, Uneekor and more. Whether you’re building a full simulator room and adding our Simulator Kit to your net, or just want accurate feedback in your garage off the monitor, iPad or TV, The Net Return gives you a stable, dependable foundation for any simulator setup.</p>",
            "tab_3_title": "Shipping & Delivery",
            "tab_3_content": "<p>Shipping is fast, FREE, and hassle‑free. Your Net Return arrives in a compact, easy‑to-handle box with everything you need inside.<br/><br/>No hidden fees, no unexpected charges, and no complicated delivery process.</p>",
            "tab_4_title": "Your Net Return Guarantee ",
            "tab_4_content": "<p>Every Net Return is backed by a 3‑year warranty and a 30‑day money‑back guarantee.<br/><br/>If anything isn’t right, whether it’s a manufacturing issue or you simply decide it’s not the right fit, you’re fully protected.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
